  "name": "Wildcard: Hammerdin procs from Paladin damage and shortens Hour of Judgement (#13099)",
  "contract": [
    "Hammerdin (282983) reads 'Damaging Paladin abilities have a 20% chance to summon a Hammer from the Heavens and",
    "reduce the cooldown of Hour of Judgement by 4 sec.' Its two PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL effects (282986 hammer, 282985",
    "cooldown reduction of 282984 by 4000 ms) carry DBC ProcFlags 0, so without a spell_proc row the aura never",
    "procs. Thirty Holy Shocks (Paladin family) at 20% leave about 0.12% odds of no 282985 cast. Hour of",
    "Judgement starts its 90 s cooldown first; every elapsed millisecond and every proc lower the remaining time, so",
    "after at least 48 s of waiting and one proc it cannot exceed 38 s."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
